 📉 The dashboard: The S&amp;P 500 closed down 0.5%, its sixth negative day in the past seven sessions.

 10-year Treasury yields are at 5.01%. 🥶 Today's stock spotlight: Dave and Buster's Entertainment (-19%) plunged after the chain's earnings report showed its prolonged slump continued.

 
 
